{"id":"n91753-1-7","stage":1,"title":"조카 · 侄子","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91753-1-7-1","ko":"우리 조카, 못 본 사이에 많이 컸구나.","zh":"我的小外甥，好久不见，长大了不少。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"조카,","meaning":"侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女","explanation":"조카：侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女。","readings":[{"term":"조카","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91753","senseId":"1","lemma":"조카","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조카","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"사이에","meaning":"间，之间，……的时候","explanation":"사이：间，之间，……的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"2","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이에","audio":"/audio/088d82d3555d167bc296.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"컸구나.","meaning":"成长","explanation":"크다：成长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66584","senseId":"2","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컸구나","audio":"/audio/db0b92fc2421e9b82ca8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f468453f8bc9c337","term":"조카","zh":"侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3","entryId":"91753","definition":"兄弟姐妹生的孩子。","pronunciation":["조카"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，……的时候","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从某一时刻到另一个时刻的时间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"成长","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66584","definition":"长大成人。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9b74de84eb5c114b4acf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91753-1-7-2","ko":"이모, 보고 싶었어요.","zh":"姨妈，我想您了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이모,","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈。","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"싶었어요.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싶었어요","audio":"/audio/0d996675be3ad68412d1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfd6511ae5195e09","term":"이모","zh":"阿姨，姨妈","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3","entryId":"71153","definition":"用于指称或称呼母亲的姐姐或妹妹。","pronunciation":["이모"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示有做前面内容的意图或欲望。","pronunciation":["십따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0bfbc91e1e0b2abf50e4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91753","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1906,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["小家伙，好久不见，怎么一点也没长大。","我的小外甥，好久不见，长大了不少。","小家伙，我们天天见，你肯定还记得我。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["姨妈，我一点也不想您。","姨妈，我还不想过来呢。","姨妈，我想您了。"],"answer":2}]}
